CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,FThe idea of introducing a visitor levy
OL,7,F- or 'tourist tax' - on visitors
OL,8,Fstaying overnight in Cumbria has been
OL,9,Fmooted as part of discussions on what
OL,10,Fpowers Cumbria's new Combined
OL,11,FAuthority could have.
OL,13,FTourist taxes have been introduced in
OL,14,Fpopular tourist cities across the
OL,15,Fworld, from Barcelona in Spain to
OL,16,FBaden-Baden in Germany.
OL,18,FWhen Andy Burnham became Prime
OL,19,FMinister last month he made devolution
OL,20,Fa cornerstone of his promise to the
OL,21,Fpublic.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,FThe first mayoral election in Cumbria
OL,7,Fwill take place in May 2027, and
OL,8,Fwhoever is elected next spring will
OL,9,Fhave the power to introduce a tourist
OL,10,Ftax.
OL,12,FCurrently there is no visitor levy
OL,13,Facross the English county, and ITV
OL,14,FBorder has found opinion is mixed on
OL,15,Fthe idea.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,FHenry Wild from Skelwith Fold Caravan
OL,7,FPark said: "When you think about
OL,8,Fyoungsters coming out to the Lake
OL,9,FDistrict, which is what we're all
OL,10,Fabout... somebody staying in a tent
OL,11,Fwould traditionally pay #10-15 a night.
OL,13,F"Those sorts of people are going to
OL,14,Fsay, 'You know what, we're not going
OL,15,Fto go to the Lake District.'
OL,17,F"The problem is that this will have a
OL,18,Fknock-on effect into the future, as if
OL,19,Fthey're not coming as teenagers to the
OL,20,FLake District, they won't be coming as
OL,21,Folder people."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G3/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,FMichael Firth, who runs the Ullswater
OL,7,FHopper Bus service, worries the levy
OL,8,Fwill punish tourists who stay the
OL,9,Fnight in the Lakes, while
OL,10,Fincentivising tourists who drive into
OL,11,Fthe area for a day trip.
OL,13,FMr Firth said: "The 20% of visitors
OL,14,Fwho are overnight visitors already
OL,15,Fcontribute a lot to the economy.
OL,17,F"We think the money should be raised
OL,18,Fin a way that promotes longer-term
OL,19,Fstays.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G4/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,F"Secondly, we want to promote car-free
OL,7,Ftransport, so we would wish to promote
OL,8,Fvisitors arriving by public transport.
OL,9,FIf visitors do so, an overnight levy
OL,10,Fdoes not encourage that, as everyone
OL,11,Fgets charged."
OL,13,FWhen ITV Border asked tourists and
OL,14,Fresidents in Windermere how they felt
OL,15,Fabout a tourism levy, however, many
OL,16,Fwere supportive.
OL,18,FOne tourist said: "It wouldn't bother
OL,19,Fme, because you have to do it whenever
OL,20,Fyou go abroad anyway. I'd happily pay
OL,21,Fit."
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G5/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,FA resident, meanwhile, said: "I think
OL,7,Fit's an excellent idea, bringing money
OL,8,Finto the area, and I don't think it
OL,9,Fwould stop people coming anyway."
OL,11,FIt is likely that Cumbria's first
OL,12,Felected mayor will make the decision
OL,13,Fon whether or not to introduce the
OL,14,Flevy.
OL,16,FLabour's candidate, David Allen, and
OL,17,FLiberal Democrat candidate Libby
OL,18,FBateman are both in favour of the
OL,19,Fidea, while Conservative candidate
OL,20,FMike Starkie has expressed his
OL,21,Fopposition.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G6/7
OL,2,W/.!+.!/*%/.!+,*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,323,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F322A1786029507
OL,3,CBid for Lake District tourist tax
OL,4,Cdivides opinion
OL,6,FFor now then, it is unclear whether
OL,7,FCumbria will follow the example of
OL,8,Ftourist hotspots like Milan, York and
OL,9,FVenice in charging overnight tourists
OL,10,Fan extra fee.
OL,12,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,13,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,14,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,15,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,16,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,17,Fbelow...
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G7/7
